1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
Reading Task

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:05,180
Big Feng to the rescue

3
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:11,680
His friends and family call him Big Feng because he is very tall and played basketball as

4
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,560
a young man.

5
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:18,300
But he is also big in a different way - he fights hard to protect China’s past.

6
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:24,440
His real name is Feng Jicai and he has written many novels about life in China.

7
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:28,960
Several years ago, however, he put down his pen for a while

8
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:31,900
and began to protect the cultural relics in Tianjin,

9
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,480
where he lives.

10
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,540
Once someone asked him why he no longer wrote.

11
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:42,520
He replied that at the moment he felt protecting cultural relics was more important.

12
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,140
Feng loves his hometown.

13
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:50,120
He believes that old things must be given a place next to new things,

14
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:53,160
or people will soon forget their great past.

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,940
He does not make speeches to get others to help him in his projects.

16
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:01,980
Instead he goes out and does what he can himself.

17
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:05,700
If others follow him, so much the better.

18
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:10,640
One of his biggest projects was to protect the oldest street in Tianjin.

19
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:19,600
Although the city government rebuilt this street,

20
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:22,000
they did save its oldest building.

21
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:37,020
This area is very important for the history of Tianjin.

22
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:41,380
It was here that the city was first built during the Song Dynasty.

23
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,860
Later many treasures were found here.

24
00:01:45,540 --> 00:01:49,740
To Feng, digging down into the earth is like reading page

25
00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:51,100
after page of a book.

26
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:55,580
Each dynasty found in the earth is like an interesting story.

27
00:01:56,600 --> 00:02:01,600
Not long ago he and other writers and artists took photos of the old parts of Tianjin.

28
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:05,980
The photos were put into a book which was very popular.

29
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,420
The money from the book helps his projects.

30
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:14,180
Once, an old man asked Feng to sign the book for him,

31
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:17,640
saying he would give it to his grandson who was not yet born.

32
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:22,320
Feng was glad to do it - he knows that the past is not only

33
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:25,860
for us to enjoy but also for the children of the future.
